  "headline": "Search and Rescue Teams Recover 26 Bodies at PT Fonusa Agung Mulia",
  "seoTitle": "PT Fonusa Agung Mulia Factory Fire in Cikande",
  "metaDescription": "Search and rescue teams have recovered 26 bodies from the site of the fatal fire at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia factory in Cikande, Serang, Banten.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue teams have recovered a total of 26 bodies from the factory site in Cikande, Serang.",
    "The Ministry of Manpower has deployed safety experts to investigate potential violations of workplace health and safety standards.",
    "Local authorities are currently collecting ante-mortem data from 33 families to assist in the victim identification process."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A fatal fire occurred at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia factory, which produces candy, located in the Cikande industrial area of Serang, Banten. Following the incident, a joint search and rescue team recovered 26 bodies from the debris. In response to the tragedy, the Indonesian Ministry of Manpower, led by Minister Yassierli, has deployed a team of investigators and workplace safety experts to examine the facility's adherence to safety protocols. Concurrently, the Ministry of Industry has dispatched an agro-industry team to the site, and the Regent of Serang, Ratu Rachmatuzakiyah, has ordered a comprehensive audit of safety management systems across local factories. Labor activists have publicly demanded accountability from company leadership regarding the incident. Identification efforts are ongoing, with 33 families submitting ante-mortem data to assist officials in identifying the victims recovered from the site.",
